From 385dd5aa1079009b88ae5e33b2219161a241a27f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:07:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bind managed interactive origin custody to adopted RPC store

Managed (RPC-store) turns lack a local state.db, so interactive native origin
capture refused them. Mint a private capability only at the post-adoption
execute seam (task custody takes precedence), pinned to agent/store/scope
credentials and pid/home/profile/gateway, and authorize each capture with a
fresh owner-fenced worker.nativeOrigin observation: exact-holder lease expiry,
normalized creation source agreeing between execution root and current
session, and owner-published compression lineage. Environment, launch labels
and replayed receipts grant nothing.
